# Desired YouTube channels to receive WebSub notifications for.
# One per line. Blank lines and lines starting with '#' are ignored.
# Each entry may be:
#   - a canonical channel id:   UCXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
#   - a handle:                 @SomeChannel
#   - a channel URL:            https://www.youtube.com/@SomeChannel
#                               https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
# Handles/URLs are resolved to UC... ids automatically (cached in resolve.cache).
#
# The server reconciles subscriptions whenever this file's mtime changes
# (checked every ~60s) and on startup. Removing a line unsubscribes that channel.

